'''Nectar''' is an item that can be obtained from the [[Supplies (Tombs of Amascut)|supplies bag]] within the [[Tombs of Amascut]].

Each dose of nectar temporarily raises [[Hitpoints]] by 15% + 3, and can boost a player's Hitpoints above their maximum Hitpoints level. It also temporarily lowers [[Attack]], [[Strength]], [[Defence]], [[Ranged]], and [[Magic]] by <math>\lfloor \frac{CurrentLevel}{20} + 5 \rfloor</math>.

==Hitpoints per dose==
Hitpoints restoration is calculated with: <math>\lfloor BaseLevel \times \frac{15}{100} \rfloor + 3</math>
