==Trivia==
* Similar to [[ambrosia]], {{wp|nectar}} ("[[wiktionary:νεκταρ|νεκταρ]]") is thought to be the fabled drink of eternal life in ancient Greek mythology. This is further reinforced by the game message when drinking it: "You drink some of the nectar. It hurts! This was not made for mortals."

